  <data key="d5">1784896984</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Zugstab">
  <data key="d0">Zugstab</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A bar subjected to tensile loading, resulting in a positive normal force and positive normal stress.&lt;SEP&gt;A fundamental stress concept related to tension rods or tie rods.&lt;SEP&gt;A tensile bar used in the text to describe the kinematics of uniaxial deformation.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-424242c0995ba02f22fe1c1864ca5f4b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67c14bdfc0522f2a0b7438b9c789bafe&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d4e48f780c214c48a682a8ccd2b8aa87-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel10_Elastostatik_Zug_und_Druck_in_Stäben.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Kapitel12_Verzerrungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1784964351</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">Zugstab</data>
</node>
<node id="Druckstab">
  <data key="d0">Druckstab</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A bar subjected to compressive loading, resulting in a negative normal force and negative normal stress.&lt;SEP&gt;A fundamental stress concept related to compression rods or members.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-424242c0995ba02f22fe1c1864ca5f4b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67c14bdfc0522f2a0b7438b9c789bafe</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel10_Elastostatik_Zug_und_Druck_in_Stäben.pdf</data>
