  <data key="d0">RWTH Aachen University Institutional Footer (footer)</data>
  <data key="d1">footer</data>
  <data key="d2">Institutional branding footer from RWTH Aachen University on page 0 of lecture materials for 'Mechanik in der Werkstofftechnik II: Elastostatik'. Contains university logo/branding and institute abbreviation (ibF), serving as academic provenance marker for course content by Prof. Dr.-Ing Sebastian Münstermann on strain state and elasticity law.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dd468369fbd1eac6b7662866f9ac8fc7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9691eaa3b3e1ab3547916750f810ae73</data>
