  <data key="d0">Source Citation Footer - Gross et al. Technische Mechanik 2 (footer)</data>
  <data key="d1">footer</data>
  <data key="d2">A bibliographic source citation attributing page content to 'Technische Mechanik 2' by Gross, Hauger, Schröder, and Wall (2017, Springer Vieweg). This German engineering mechanics textbook serves as the foundational reference for material covering constitutive laws, stress-strain relationships, and experimental determination of material properties through tensile/compression testing.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7191762e3c837260ad5bf3f1bc50f25a</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel10_Elastostatik_Zug_und_Druck_in_Stäben.pdf</data>
