  <data key="d1">footer</data>
  <data key="d2">This footer serves as a bibliographic citation attributing the page's content to the textbook 'Technische Mechanik 2' (2017) by Gross, Hauger, Schröder, and Wall, published by Springer Vieweg. It provides academic validation for the surrounding explanations of the Law of Elasticity, plane stress states, and shear modulus.</data>
