  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Factors incorporated into the allowable stress to provide safety against yielding, fracture, or other failure modes.&lt;SEP&gt;Margins of safety calculated in complex 3D loaded components to prevent plastic deformation.</data>
