  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Features in structural members where non-uniform stress distributions and stress concentrations occur, requiring advanced methods beyond the elementary formula.&lt;SEP&gt;Features such as notches (Kerben) or bar ends (Stabenden) that create non-uniform stress distributions.</data>
