  <data key="d2">A field of science concerned with the behavior of physical bodies when subjected to forces, representing the overarching subject of the educational presentation.&lt;SEP&gt;A field of science that is the thematic context of the surrounding lecture content.&lt;SEP&gt;The scientific domain or field of study relevant to the surrounding text discussing coordinate transformation and principal stresses.&lt;SEP&gt;A scientific field in which the technical diagram is used to represent states of stress.</data>
