</node>
<node id="Internal Axial Force">
  <data key="d0">Internal Axial Force</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The normal force N induced in the rod by the boundary constraints, which creates mechanical strains that exactly offset the thermal expansion.&lt;SEP&gt;The force S within a bar, determined from equilibrium conditions at node C&lt;SEP&gt;The internal force ($S_i$) within each bar of the three-bar system, which Hooke's Law relates to the change in length, initial length, and axial rigidity</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fe61c354100bb43a98ebc62d57cf28c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe1aa2ab22c57b58f370cf064cf7ce98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abc3cadf3a789dbb882aa778366ab3b3</data>
