  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A textbook on engineering mechanics covering advanced mechanics of materials topics such as rod displacement, thermal expansion, stiffness, and support reactions.&lt;SEP&gt;A textbook focused on structural analysis (Festigkeitslehre/Statik) covering equilibrium conditions, thermal expansion effects, deformation calculations, and force determination in bar and truss systems.&lt;SEP&gt;A compiled academic document, likely containing multiple sections or chapters, functioning as lecture notes or a textbook.&lt;SEP&gt;A textbook on engineering mechanics that covers 'Festigkeitslehre' (strength of materials) and contains the page discussing statically determinate bar systems.&lt;SEP&gt;A German engineering mechanics textbook containing sections on statically indeterminate systems, with content on page 25 continuing a worked example of a three-bar system.&lt;SEP&gt;The document containing the continuous exposition of Mohr's circle analysis, providing a systematic treatment of stress analysis and Festigkeitslehre (strength of materials).</data>
