</node>
<node id="Kinematic Relationship">
  <data key="d0">Kinematic Relationship</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A relationship within section 10.4 connecting thermal effects to deformation in structural analysis, of which the thermal expansion law forms a part&lt;SEP&gt;A fundamental relationship defined by the partial derivative of v with respect to x, representing half of the engineering shear strain.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a371746d42ee15c97ccf2f983b9237ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24d9eb0ca31bb4557fd92f27b7b1a466</data>
