<node id="Mechanik in der Werkstofftechnik II: Elastostatik">
  <data key="d0">Mechanik in der Werkstofftechnik II: Elastostatik</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A lecture series on Mechanics in Materials Technology II: Elastostatics, part of a presentation series delivered by Univ. Prof. Dr.-Ing Sebastian Münstermann.&lt;SEP&gt;A lecture material covering Chapter 10: Zug und Druck in Stäben, associated with materials engineering education at RWTH Aachen University.&lt;SEP&gt;An academic lecture course or document containing organizational information, contact persons, and communication channels.&lt;SEP&gt;A course or lecture document covering mechanics in materials engineering, specifically focusing on elastostatics.&lt;SEP&gt;A lecture on Mechanics in Materials Engineering II: Elastostatics.&lt;SEP&gt;A German-language academic document on Mechanics in Materials Engineering II: Elastostatics.</data>
