<node id="Normal Stress σ(x)">
  <data key="d0">Normal Stress σ(x)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The normal stress in an arbitrary cross-section of the non-prismatic bar, defined by the equation σ(x) = N(x) / A(x)&lt;SEP&gt;The normal stress function defined as σ(x) = N(x) / A(x), representing the stress distribution along the length of the conical bar in solid mechanics.</data>
