</node>
<node id="Two-Bar Truss System">
  <data key="d0">Two-Bar Truss System</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A statically determinate structural system used for analyzing tension, compression, and displacement.&lt;SEP&gt;A structural mechanics system consisting of two bars subjected to load, analyzed for displacement.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6681170cb4ff75b4d310df8342f3aad9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-94aa1e1d6b738ff40ac94957c9a7084a</data>
