<node id="Normal Stress Distribution σ(x)">
  <data key="d0">Normal Stress Distribution σ(x)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The normal stress distribution along the longitudinal axis of a conical compression rod, given by σ(x) = -F/[π·r₀²·(1 + x/l)²], where stress magnitude decreases quadratically with x, being maximum at x = 0 with σ_max = -F/(π·r₀²)</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cf7cfa532d0224ec6532c6354495df59</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel10_Elastostatik_Zug_und_Druck_in_Stäben.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1784896978</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
