  <data key="d0">Kinematic Formulations</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Advanced formulations describing the kinematics of single bar systems, representing an endpoint in the logical flow from basic concepts in the document.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e31c68f0ed98d537493847b61aa6024c</data>
