<node id="Diagram A">
  <data key="d0">Diagram A</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">This figure serves as the primary reference model depicting a gray rectangular bar with a longitudinal axis and specific cross-sectional planes.&lt;SEP&gt;A technical schematic diagram illustrating a horizontal bar fixed at both ends, composed of two distinct segments.&lt;SEP&gt;A schematic diagram displaying a horizontal bar composed of two segments attached to rigid supports B and C.&lt;SEP&gt;A three-dimensional isometric view of a grey cylindrical pressure vessel showing its diameter (2r), internal pressure (p), and a highlighted green square element on the outer surface.</data>
