<node id="Diagram B">
  <data key="d0">Diagram B</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">This figure focuses on the region near cut 's-s' and shows the non-uniform stress distribution at the points where external forces are applied.&lt;SEP&gt;A simplified mechanical model or free-body diagram of the horizontal bar showing reaction forces.&lt;SEP&gt;A free-body-style representation of the two-segment bar showing compressive reaction forces at positions B and C.&lt;SEP&gt;A technical diagram illustrating the free-body diagram of a central node designated as K.&lt;SEP&gt;A magnified two-dimensional view of the green square element from the vessel surface, showing tensile stresses on all four faces with horizontal arrows labeled σ_x and vertical arrows labeled σ_φ.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8f7107d9e481e8d7b78079a1c4ff9229&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cdfa6405eb28772fd593fe970821beaf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ccf2b44f3719aa488a2e1148c9ed36db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df979c16e8c52bf800fb84c3a4a4bdea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-887f545fd528c5ed1b7980ed83618c38</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel10_Elastostatik_Zug_und_Druck_in_Stäben.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Kapitel11_Spannungszustand.pdf</data>
