<node id="German Engineering Mechanics Document">
  <data key="d0">German Engineering Mechanics Document</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A textbook or lecture material covering Festigkeitslehre, including topics on stress, strain, kinematics, and constitutive laws.&lt;SEP&gt;A technical reference document on stress analysis mechanics that contains section 11.2.3 discussing Mohr's Stress Circle.&lt;SEP&gt;A document covering engineering mechanics topics, specifically focusing on kinematic relationships and tensor transformations in 2D strain analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;A document that covers continuum mechanics, stress analysis, and failure criteria, including section 12.3 on strength hypotheses.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-23f9a8f34af690fb6d5cb0ea12f409a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1678f499f1d6db4c88e28c21ca3f7ac4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa48b17598f3ede3e70d188e862d9e1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d57d772e71ccd830b12050844ec9eef2</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel10_Elastostatik_Zug_und_Druck_in_Stäben.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Kapitel11_Spannungszustand.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Kapitel12_Verzerrungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1784999089</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Bars With Variable Cross-sections">
  <data key="d0">Bars With Variable Cross-sections</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Structural elements discussed in the document regarding local strain.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-23f9a8f34af690fb6d5cb0ea12f409a1</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel10_Elastostatik_Zug_und_Druck_in_Stäben.pdf</data>
