<node id="Thermal Effects">
  <data key="d0">Thermal Effects</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Additional physical phenomena considered in more complex statically indeterminate problems beyond the basic governing ODE&lt;SEP&gt;Effects related to temperature changes, which are neglected in the governing equation due to the assumption of a constant temperature difference (ΔT = konst.).&lt;SEP&gt;A technical concept related to mechanics and structural analysis covered in Section 10.7 of the lecture document.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f4f759f99f5a784630c625df026ca993&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17078647094adcc12a6785492579bc48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fed5dfab36680bc0a576b0ed9cc7e5a</data>
