<node id="Footer">
  <data key="d0">Footer</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Footer is a standard digital page element utilized within a German academic lecture document. Its primary function is to serve as a bibliographic source citation and attribution mechanism for the educational material. By providing proper academic attribution, this element fulfills both legal and academic purposes, establishing the provenance for the surrounding educational content. 

Positioned consistently at the bottom of the document's pages, the Footer appears in multiple specific instances throughout the text, including pages 7, 8, 17, and 28. On page 7, it is specifically located at the bottom-center. In addition to offering general source citations, this page element incorporates institutional branding and explicitly cites reference textbooks used in the lecture materials, such as 'Technische Mechanik 2'.&lt;SEP&gt;A footer element positioned at the bottom-right of page 0 of the academic document, containing the institutional branding elements 'ibF' and 'RWTHAACHENUNIVERSITY'</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6d7acbcd6b20eaf7e62181f096df8a5e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e808a43e592e78037efdbadafb6d692e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b35bef5073db0c5a31b6dd2e83c0ddb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d59edb59253a1c7bdee6d99d3f2cc4d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83ac1dafe6c2621a4fb3a412b3493553&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ffd7059b21365543021b6e1a5ac8087&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0f20e6bdef6f836f08f3407dd794183&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e3cdc6151a0814d04d2cc632b0969f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd468369fbd1eac6b7662866f9ac8fc7</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel10_Elastostatik_Zug_und_Druck_in_Stäben.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Kapitel11_Spannungszustand.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Kapitel12_Verzerrungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1784998770</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
