  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">An example problem of a hanging bar under self-weight with statically determinate conditions, constant cross-sectional area, constant axial stiffness, and constant temperature change, used to determine length change and stress.&lt;SEP&gt;A statically determinate problem in elastostatics involving a hanging bar subjected to its own weight.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cc79c4ab764f023bc17eed0dd0b44b48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17b87724a453e2805522671a76c088ec</data>
