</node>
<node id="Temperature Change ΔT">
  <data key="d0">Temperature Change ΔT</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A loading condition applied to the hanging bar problem that is constant (ΔT = const.) under the given conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;The constant temperature difference denoted by ΔT, relevant to thermal loading in the governing differential equation for statically indeterminate structures.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cc79c4ab764f023bc17eed0dd0b44b48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0963d089a81497869e206f806e6e66d1</data>
