<node id="Kinematic Compatibility Conditions">
  <data key="d0">Kinematic Compatibility Conditions</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Conditions ensuring geometric consistency of deformations, expressed as Δl=Δl₁+Δl₂=0, used in the force method.&lt;SEP&gt;Conditions relating displacements in the structural system, likely presented on page 24.&lt;SEP&gt;Geometric constraints ensuring consistent displacements among the bars, involving the vertical displacement projection of node K onto the inclined bars.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c5d7eea8f9e0a901768256832130203b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9966746921724686a393e234327d9e41&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06a907de5d496ddcf9ab58b307c8f8ed</data>
