  <data key="d2">A page in the lecture material that continues with solution steps including substitution into Δl₁ = Δl₂ cos α, determination of Stabkraft S₂, vertical displacement Δl₂, and bar forces S₁,₃.&lt;SEP&gt;A page number element '20' located at the bottom-left of page 19 (0-indexed) of a German-language mechanical engineering document.</data>
