  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Graphical representations discussed in subsequent pages that relate stress to strain, building upon the foundation of kinematic measures.&lt;SEP&gt;Diagrams used for analyzing elastic bodies under load through tensile/compressive testing&lt;SEP&gt;Diagrams visualizing the results of tensile and compression tests.&lt;SEP&gt;Graphical representations of stress-strain relationships mentioned in the text.</data>
