  <data key="d0">Page 25</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">The page number '25' appearing as a navigational element at the bottom-left of page index 20, placed at coordinates [27, 907, 43, 927], following standard Arabic numeral pagination conventions in the German engineering mechanics textbook.&lt;SEP&gt;The page containing the initial problem setup for the worked example discussed in the text.&lt;SEP&gt;Indicates page 25 of a German-language mechanics/continuum mechanics document, positioned at the bottom in a standard footer location.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3891c97c9b24173fa3943bf0d59b8fa9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a7d19da473048f7577c45363a2702e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b8f3f8c72a4f9a9fdeabe99c8c8ba4e</data>
