  <data key="d2">A page number element displaying '19', located at the bottom of the page (bbox coordinates [29, 907, 43, 927]) within a German engineering mechanics textbook, serving as a navigational and organizational element.&lt;SEP&gt;A page in the German engineering mechanics textbook containing the problem setup for the three-bar system worked example.&lt;SEP&gt;A structural navigation element in the textbook marking a critical transition point.</data>
