<node id="Zusammenfassung">
  <data key="d0">Zusammenfassung</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Summary section where the general elongation formula combining mechanical and thermal effects is presented&lt;SEP&gt;The summary section (Chapter 11.4) of a continuum mechanics or strength of materials lecture/document, which comprehensively wraps up the preceding discussion on stress states.&lt;SEP&gt;A summary section within Section 11.4 of the textbook that marks the conclusion of detailed theoretical derivations covering various mechanics topics.&lt;SEP&gt;A comprehensive summary section of Chapter 11.4.</data>
