  <data key="d0">Wahre Querschnittsfläche</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">German term meaning 'True cross-sectional area,' referring to the actual cross-sectional area of a material during deformation, as opposed to the nominal or engineering area.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7a438fa813ee176d3e3d64cd5a7e2dba</data>
