  <data key="d2">A quantity whose components possess two coordinate indices and transform according to a specific rule when transitioning between rotated coordinate systems&lt;SEP&gt;A formally defined mathematical object (Tensor 2. Stufe) discussed in the lecture content, characterized as being rotation-invariant.</data>
