<node id="Determinant">
  <data key="d0">Determinant</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A mathematical property of the stress tensor calculated as sigma_x * sigma_y - tau_xy^2, which serves as another invariant of the stress tensor.&lt;SEP&gt;A mathematical property mentioned as another invariant of the stress tensor, alongside the sum of normal stresses&lt;SEP&gt;A tensor invariant of the stress tensor calculated as ($\sigma_x \sigma_y - \tau_{xy}^2$).</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-ba92f82e2b057ed886fb58574a01ea0a-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ba92f82e2b057ed886fb58574a01ea0a-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68094852a469c1054fde9d0f452e6077</data>
