  <data key="d1">page_number</data>
  <data key="d2">Page number 14 acts as a pagination marker for a mechanics lecture document. It anchors section 11.2.1 on coordinate transformation, specifically marking the theoretical transition where derived stress transformation equations are formally defined as a rotationally invariant 2nd-order tensor.</data>
