  <data key="d1">footer</data>
  <data key="d2">This footer provides a bibliographic citation for the slide's content, referencing the textbook "Technische Mechanik 2" by Gross, Hauger, Schröder, and Wall (2017). It establishes the academic source for the engineering mechanics concepts discussed, such as the hypothesis of shape change energy and Hooke's law, linking the presentation's theoretical derivations to established literature.</data>
