  <data key="d0">Blue Right-Pointing Directional Arrow (image)</data>
  <data key="d1">image</data>
  <data key="d2">This image shows a simple, solid blue arrow pointing to the right. Within the provided technical context regarding stress analysis and tensor transformations, this icon likely represents a specific coordinate direction (e.g., the x-direction) or serves as a navigational aid to indicate the flow of a derivation or the orientation of a principal stress axis.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-011c3fc433230965d7a734e4052f7689</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel11_Spannungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1784901716</data>
