  <data key="d0">Page 18 (page_number)</data>
  <data key="d1">page_number</data>
  <data key="d2">Page number '18' marks a specific page in a technical document focusing on mechanics. It grounds the continuation of section 11.2.2 'Hauptspannungen' (Principal Stresses), which details the mathematical derivation of principal stress magnitudes and the condition of zero shear stress at principal directions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7ef0d1a935f39ab673c43461c36533f7</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel11_Spannungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1784901716</data>
