  <data key="d1">equation</data>
  <data key="d2">A mathematically inconsistent equation (LHS=0.004, RHS=12) that does not correspond to any standard relationship in stress analysis. It appears unrelated to the surrounding discussion of principal stresses (Hauptspannungen), extremal shear stresses, and Mohr's stress circle, likely resulting from transcription or OCR errors.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dd747436c8f7ae4c9f1ad317397dda30</data>
