<node id="Analytical Stress Transformation and Mohr's Circle Formulation (equation)">
  <data key="d0">Analytical Stress Transformation and Mohr's Circle Formulation (equation)</data>
  <data key="d1">equation</data>
  <data key="d2">Despite severe OCR corruption, this equation represents the fundamental algebraic derivation of principal stresses and maximum shear stresses in a 2D plane stress state. It serves as the analytical foundation for constructing Mohr's Circle, allowing engineers to evaluate extremal stress values and predict structural failure without solely relying on graphical methods.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bcd5ad0575ad16303ca4601a26ea32f2</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel11_Spannungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1784901716</data>
</node>
