  <data key="d1">footer</data>
  <data key="d2">A bibliographic source attribution footer citing the textbook 'Technische Mechanik 2' by Gross, Hauger, Schröder, and Wall (2017, Springer Vieweg). Located on a page discussing Mohr's Stress Circle construction for plane stress analysis. This footer indicates the educational content and diagrams derive from a standard reference in German engineering mechanics literature.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8e6a6756f3e11958caa7f25916a94bb6</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel11_Spannungszustand.pdf</data>
