  <data key="d2">A bibliographic citation footer attributing page 22 content about Mohr's Stress Circle to 'Technische Mechanik 2' by Gross, Hauger, Schröder, and Wall (2017, Springer Vieweg). It provides academic provenance for diagrams and explanations of stress circle construction and principal stress determination within the lecture material.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5db8101dd80f03fc824342c78093902c</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel11_Spannungszustand.pdf</data>
