<node id="Stress Tensor Coordinate Transformation">
  <data key="d0">Stress Tensor Coordinate Transformation</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Also known as Koordinatentransformation, the procedure for transforming stress components under coordinate rotation according to tensor transformation laws.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cd1f71b01c1aa5c67c36a16a597748fb</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel11_Spannungszustand.pdf</data>
