<node id="Mohr's Circle Center">
  <data key="d0">Mohr's Circle Center</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The center of Mohr's circle, calculated using the formula sigma_M = (sigma_x + sigma_y)/2, representing the average of the normal stress components.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a5f08150d01a4afad6a7e20e54169ec1</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel11_Spannungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1784903843</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Mohr's Circle Radius">
  <data key="d0">Mohr's Circle Radius</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The radius of Mohr's circle, calculated as R = sqrt(((sigma_x - sigma_y)/2)^2 + tau_xy^2), used to determine the magnitude of principal stresses.&lt;SEP&gt;The radius R of Mohr's Circle, determined using the Euclidean norm of stress differences: R = sqrt(((σ_x - σ_y)/2)^2 + τ_xy^2).</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a5f08150d01a4afad6a7e20e54169ec1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bcd5ad0575ad16303ca4601a26ea32f2</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel11_Spannungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1784903843</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Normal Stress Transformation">
  <data key="d0">Normal Stress Transformation</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The stress transformation equation sigma(varphi) = sigma_M + R*cos(2*varphi) for calculating normal stress at a given rotation angle varphi.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a5f08150d01a4afad6a7e20e54169ec1</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel11_Spannungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1784903843</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Shear Stress Transformation">
  <data key="d0">Shear Stress Transformation</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The stress transformation equation tau(varphi) = R*sin(2*varphi) for calculating shear stress at a given rotation angle varphi.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a5f08150d01a4afad6a7e20e54169ec1</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel11_Spannungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1784903843</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Sigma-Tau Plane">
