  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A shear stress vector pointing to the right in the positive ξ direction on the face perpendicular to the η-axis.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3cdbbf7d68148fe88c3174f0ea8e4742</data>
