  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The left intersection point of the Mohr's Circle with the σ-axis, located at the origin (0,0), representing a principal normal stress of zero.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-30b2a42c115ed62e72e715daa89e2370</data>
