<node id="Normal And Shear Stresses">
  <data key="d0">Normal And Shear Stresses</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Types of stresses for which transformation equations are discussed in the lecture content.&lt;SEP&gt;Stresses whose extremal values are examined as functions of the cutting angle φ in Section 11.2.2.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a3186598e4d31ef04b0826dc0b3dad17&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f44965262ad3a19924f66261ac5694c5</data>
