<node id="Cutting Angle">
  <data key="d0">Cutting Angle</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">An angle, denoted as φ, that determines the extremal values of normal and shear stresses, discussed in Section 11.2.2.&lt;SEP&gt;The angle $\varphi$ with respect to which the derivative of the normal stress is taken and set to zero&lt;SEP&gt;An arbitrary angle φ, such as 30°, at which stress transformation calculations are performed.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a3186598e4d31ef04b0826dc0b3dad17&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2839b8d3cca96c984fc98ff0599ca3a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3553477d678ccfb56c56a99c6a713a1b</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel11_Spannungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1784904035</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Plane Stress State (ESZ)">
  <data key="d0">Plane Stress State (ESZ)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A two-dimensional stress state condition (ebener Spannungszustand) analyzed under Mohr's circle methodology, fundamental for analyzing stress in structural components.&lt;SEP&gt;A stress state (ebener Spannungszustand) in which stresses occur only in a plane, applicable to the thin-walled vessel wall where no shear stresses occur&lt;SEP&gt;A two-dimensional stress state in solid mechanics for which the mathematical equation mirrors a 2D equilibrium differential equation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2f30cb257f67e16a0ea99ccc999878b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1f8906173d951132fd77877e8868d53&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14e4d70cf188ab298b97a6d1cf9e80c8</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel11_Spannungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1784904035</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="2D Equilibrium Differential Equation">
  <data key="d0">2D Equilibrium Differential Equation</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A differential equation of the form ∂σx/∂x + ∂τyx/∂y + fx = 0 that describes static equilibrium in a plane stress state.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2f30cb257f67e16a0ea99ccc999878b4</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel11_Spannungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1784904035</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="dünnwandiger Kessel">
  <data key="d0">dünnwandiger Kessel</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A thin-walled spherical vessel whose structural integrity can be analyzed using discretized differential equations in engineering problems.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2f30cb257f67e16a0ea99ccc999878b4</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel11_Spannungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1784904035</data>
