<node id="Material Failure Theories">
  <data key="d0">Material Failure Theories</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Theoretical frameworks for predicting material yielding and fracture, which utilize stress transformation&lt;SEP&gt;Theoretical frameworks, such as the Distortion Energy Hypothesis, used to predict the failure or yielding of materials under stress.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3780797c1d45f39538f2b68c98e007f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b7593a3adc530882efa765d69efe9aa0</data>
