  <data key="d0">Equation $\Sigma M^{(M)} = 0$</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A mathematical equation representing the principle of moment equilibrium, stating that the algebraic sum of all moments acting on a body evaluated with respect to a specific reference point M must equal zero.</data>
