  <data key="d0">Stress Theory</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A branch of mechanics discussed in the textbook, focusing on the systematic progression from stress vector definition to tensor formulation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-60e545266c1919041c313cfba39a94c4</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel11_Spannungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1784904048</data>
