  <data key="d0">Section 11.1 Spannungsvektor Und Spannungstensor</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A section in the German Mechanics/Engineering Textbook dealing with the Stress Vector and Stress Tensor.&lt;SEP&gt;A textbook section titled 'Stress Vector and Stress Tensor' covering fundamental concepts of stress analysis in three-dimensional bodies, including the decomposition of stress vectors and derivation of stress tensor symmetry.&lt;SEP&gt;A preceding section in Chapter 11 dealing with stress vectors and stress tensors, covered on pages before page number 11.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9cabab253ce4ee75c98c51cfd7f1a27b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-677dd5182b714188875fefaff19c7680&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1685984065ed0dcd54dea046d7d4f918</data>
