</node>
<node id="dy">
  <data key="d0">dy</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The total width dimension of the rectangular element measured along the y-axis, composed of dy/2 on each side of Point M&lt;SEP&gt;The total width of the material element along the y-axis, divided into two equal segments of dy/2.&lt;SEP&gt;The geometric dimension labeled in green text representing the length of the vertical leg along the y-axis.&lt;SEP&gt;The vertical side length of the original square element PQRS.&lt;SEP&gt;A small distance representing the spatial offset or displacement of a neighboring point in the context of small displacements.&lt;SEP&gt;The labeled vertical side length of the original undeformed square element PQRS.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cb64a0edb671186691ad9f74cd07ae9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c2cf3a337f73c88af5880c2708e9c48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b23912fb95dffaea41a466afd896e511&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90cfec891927772de90cde9aa609de48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e8d2b1a89f6cabb7e72a9e7705515dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-916a73aa729828741cee96b82bd0ae84</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel11_Spannungszustand.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Kapitel12_Verzerrungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1784998939</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="dz">
  <data key="d0">dz</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The total height dimension of the rectangular element measured along the z-axis, composed of dz/2 above and below Point M&lt;SEP&gt;The total height of the material element along the z-axis, divided into two segments of dz/2.</data>
