<node id="Extremum Condition For Normal Stresses">
  <data key="d0">Extremum Condition For Normal Stresses</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The mathematical condition dσξ/dφ = 0 implying tan(2φ*) = 2τxy/(σx - σy), used to determine principal directions in a 2D stress state</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2839b8d3cca96c984fc98ff0599ca3a1</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel11_Spannungszustand.pdf</data>
