  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The OCR artifact (2/10) × (2/10) = (2×2)/10 = 2/10, an algebraically false equation that is a corrupted version of the trigonometric condition for principal directions</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2839b8d3cca96c984fc98ff0599ca3a1</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel11_Spannungszustand.pdf</data>
