  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The educational context from which Section 11.2.2 "Hauptspannungen" and the garbled OCR equation originate&lt;SEP&gt;The broader source material from which the anomalous mathematical equation and surrounding strain analysis context were taken.</data>
