  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The angle, denoted as φ*, defining the principal stress orientation, related to the stress components by the equation tan 2φ* = 2τ_xy/(σ_x - σ_y).&lt;SEP&gt;The reference direction relative to which the observation plane is rotated by the angle phi.</data>
