  <data key="d0">Normal Stress Sigma Y</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The normal stress component acting on the orthogonal y face of the triangular wedge element&lt;SEP&gt;The original normal stress component in the Cartesian y-direction of the coordinate system.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-82d26e50b1a6b9a189224f9805e4217e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f852bec3a8e229cf7fc9b647545ae29</data>
