  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The shear stress component acting on the x and y faces of the triangular wedge element&lt;SEP&gt;The original shear stress component acting on the x and y planes in the Cartesian coordinate system.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-82d26e50b1a6b9a189224f9805e4217e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f852bec3a8e229cf7fc9b647545ae29</data>
