<node id="Transformation Formula Sigma Xi">
  <data key="d0">Transformation Formula Sigma Xi</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The standard formula sigma_xi = sigma_x cos^2 varphi + sigma_y sin^2 varphi + 2 tau_xy sin varphi cos varphi obtained by simplifying the equilibrium equation</data>
