<node id="Σ,η-coordinate System">
  <data key="d0">Σ,η-coordinate System</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The rotated Cartesian coordinate system aligned parallel and perpendicular to the oblique cut surface.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ae7aec8cf21235bd79c851b9cc6978f8</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel11_Spannungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1784904048</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Oblique Cut Face">
  <data key="d0">Oblique Cut Face</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The slanted surface of the triangular element, characterized by its area dA, where the unknown shear stress acts.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ae7aec8cf21235bd79c851b9cc6978f8</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel11_Spannungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1784904048</data>
