</node>
<node id="Sigma 1">
  <data key="d0">Sigma 1</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The principal stress acting on the vertical-facing sides of the material element, denoted as sigma 1, where sigma 1 is greater than sigma 2.&lt;SEP&gt;The maximum principal stress, represented by a red dot where the circle intersects the horizontal sigma-axis.&lt;SEP&gt;The maximum principal stress, approximately 61 MPa, determined from the given stress state using Mohr's stress circle&lt;SEP&gt;The specific point on the right where Mohr's Circle intersects the horizontal axis, representing one of the principal stresses.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fb9e40b1a13627933f97ce043e59f768&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8be23ae96862171a1f9cb78cb1cfcb0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea236c2c090948676eebcd4986bd6df7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16cb12dda8d30577bdf35b6755d86117</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel11_Spannungszustand.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Kapitel12_Verzerrungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1784999477</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Sigma 2">
  <data key="d0">Sigma 2</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The principal stress acting on the horizontal-facing sides of the material element, denoted as sigma 2.&lt;SEP&gt;The minimum principal stress, represented by a red dot where the circle intersects the horizontal sigma-axis.&lt;SEP&gt;The minimum principal stress, approximately -31 MPa, determined from the given stress state&lt;SEP&gt;The specific point on the left where Mohr's Circle intersects the horizontal axis, representing one of the principal stresses.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fb9e40b1a13627933f97ce043e59f768&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8be23ae96862171a1f9cb78cb1cfcb0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea236c2c090948676eebcd4986bd6df7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16cb12dda8d30577bdf35b6755d86117</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel11_Spannungszustand.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Kapitel12_Verzerrungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1784999477</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="2 Varphi Angle">
  <data key="d0">2 Varphi Angle</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">An arc labeled as 2varphi* indicating twice the physical angle of rotation required to reach the principal plane.</data>
