  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The physical plane reached by rotation, corresponding to half the angular relationship indicated by the arc in Mohr's Circle.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fb9e40b1a13627933f97ce043e59f768</data>
