  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The mathematical formula σ_{1,2} = (σ_x + σ_y)/2 ± √[((σ_x - σ_y)/2)² + τ_xy²] used to compute principal stresses.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3553477d678ccfb56c56a99c6a713a1b</data>
