  <data key="d0">Eigenvalue Problem</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">The mathematical problem characterizing principal stresses, where principal stresses are eigenvalues and principal directions are eigenvectors of the stress tensor.&lt;SEP&gt;A mathematical problem solved by stress transformation equations for the Cauchy stress tensor to determine principal stresses.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a6643a9ec6dd9b81db5b4233bf1899ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bcd5ad0575ad16303ca4601a26ea32f2</data>
