  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A coordinate system characterized by principal stresses σ₁ and σ₂ used in two-dimensional stress analysis&lt;SEP&gt;The coordinate system defined by principal axes, where the digits '1' and '2' visible in the anomalous equation may potentially correspond to coordinate axes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dd747436c8f7ae4c9f1ad317397dda30&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93703d14a7c8d37c2c5e2aae854f6240</data>
