  <data key="d0">Principal Shear Stresses (Hauptschubspannungen)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Extremal values of shear stresses occurring at angles φ** oriented at 45° to the principal stress directions in stress transformation theory</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dd747436c8f7ae4c9f1ad317397dda30</data>
