  <data key="d0">2φ</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">An angle denoted by a magenta/pink arc originating from center M, located between the horizontal radius and the radius to the point (σξ, τη), representing twice the physical rotation of the stress element to an arbitrary plane defined by angle φ.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5ca440e5727deb504109d3cda9b3642d</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel11_Spannungszustand.pdf</data>
