<node id="τ_{ξη}">
  <data key="d0">τ_{ξη}</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Shear stress on the inclined face (ξ-face) in the η-direction.&lt;SEP&gt;The calculated shear stress component in a rotated (transformed) coordinate system (ξ, η), approximately -13.5 MPa, acting on a sectional plane whose normal forms an angle φ = 30° with the original x-axis. The negative sign indicates the shear stress acts in the opposite sense relative to the chosen positive rotational direction.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b1f8906173d951132fd77877e8868d53&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20d2489764cb6b004e3ff06ba7ebe0c1</data>
