  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A transformed coordinate system whose principal axes are denoted by the Greek indices ξ and η, obtained through tensor transformation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b1f8906173d951132fd77877e8868d53</data>
