  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A section introducing the analysis of thin-walled vessels (Dünnwandiger Kessel), beginning the theoretical examination of thin-walled cylindrical pressure vessels subjected to internal pressure.&lt;SEP&gt;A specific document section that discusses thin-walled pressure vessels (dünnwandiger Kessel) and biaxial stress states.</data>
