  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Complex loading conditions under which mechanical components are evaluated for yielding or fracture using stress analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;A condition of applying stress in multiple directions, which mechanical components are subjected to.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6b47aa4fc45ad067947c357da574f854&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-343794ade2b1d656c68e2c17454713f5</data>
