  <data key="d0">τ_zy</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Shear stress component acting on the z-plane in the y-direction, where the first index z denotes the axis normal to the plane and the second index y denotes the direction of the stress vector&lt;SEP&gt;A shear stress component used in the moment equilibrium derivation, shown to be equal to τ_yz.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bf36ff85412f3dea295a176bbfb87119&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b23912fb95dffaea41a466afd896e511</data>
