<node id="Stress Tensor Symmetry">
  <data key="d0">Stress Tensor Symmetry</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A physical concept mathematically proven by equating the shear stress components τ_yz and τ_zy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bf36ff85412f3dea295a176bbfb87119</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel11_Spannungszustand.pdf</data>
