</node>
<node id="F_yz">
  <data key="d0">F_yz</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A resultant force variable derived by grouping force-area products involving τ_yz in the equation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bf36ff85412f3dea295a176bbfb87119</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel11_Spannungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1784904052</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="F_zy">
  <data key="d0">F_zy</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A resultant force variable derived by grouping force-area products involving τ_zy in the equation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bf36ff85412f3dea295a176bbfb87119</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel11_Spannungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1784904052</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Area Element">
  <data key="d0">Area Element</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Differential area components, specifically dxdz and dxdy, used in the mathematical derivation to calculate forces on the cubic element.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bf36ff85412f3dea295a176bbfb87119</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel11_Spannungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1784904052</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Lever Arm">
  <data key="d0">Lever Arm</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Distance components, specifically dy/2 and dz/2, multiplied by forces to calculate the moment in the equilibrium equation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bf36ff85412f3dea295a176bbfb87119</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel11_Spannungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1784904052</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="LaTeX">
  <data key="d0">LaTeX</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A document preparation system and typesetting method used to render the standard serif font typical of the scientific text shown in the image.&lt;SEP&gt;The typesetting format used to represent the generalized Hooke's Law equation in the provided text.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bf36ff85412f3dea295a176bbfb87119&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a375818483fffe9d5cdc368f45b60b8</data>
