<node id="Extreme Values Of Shear Stresses">
  <data key="d0">Extreme Values Of Shear Stresses</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The extreme (maximum) values that shear stresses can reach within the study of stress states, referenced as 'Extremalwerte der Schubspannungen' in the surrounding textual context.</data>
