  <data key="d0">Two-dimensional State Of Stress</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A state of mechanical stress acting on a differential element in two dimensions, illustrated by the technical schematic diagram.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-012dfb2f1f77750672c0c98cb5c5f782</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel11_Spannungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1784904052</data>
