</node>
<node id="Stress State Coordinate Transformation Diagram">
  <data key="d0">Stress State Coordinate Transformation Diagram</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A technical schematic diagram illustrating the concept of coordinate transformation for a two-dimensional stress state, showing an infinitesimal element with original and rotated coordinate systems and stress components.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-65f35adb2f34cbe81a9755002339ad40</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel11_Spannungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1784904052</data>
