<node id="Normal Stress Components">
  <data key="d0">Normal Stress Components</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The stress components σ_x and σ_y acting normal to surfaces, used in computing the hydrostatic stress and the radius of Mohr's Circle.&lt;SEP&gt;The normal stress components in Cartesian coordinates (σ_y and σ_x) that contribute to axial deformation and lateral contraction.&lt;SEP&gt;The stress components ($\sigma_x, \sigma_y, \sigma_z$) acting along the Cartesian axes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bcd5ad0575ad16303ca4601a26ea32f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90b46de3a3db50a2d58052925f2088b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95513f4440188d0181ac3f745cc0cfe1</data>
