  <data key="d0">Bibliographic Source Footer (footer)</data>
  <data key="d1">footer</data>
  <data key="d2">This footer serves as a bibliographic citation attributing the page's content to the textbook "Technische Mechanik 2" by Gross, Hauger, Schröder, and Wall (2017), published by Springer Vieweg. It provides academic provenance for the surrounding technical mechanics concepts, specifically the definitions and tensor mathematics related to the plane strain state (Verzerrungszustand).</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4f216e53729f0289f4928b85007a2c88</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel12_Verzerrungszustand.pdf</data>
