  <data key="d1">equation</data>
  <data key="d2">A mathematically inconsistent numerical equation (LHS = 0.2 ≠ RHS ≈ 1.333) appearing within German mechanics lecture notes on plane strain state (EVZ). Likely a corrupted or incomplete calculation related to strain tensor transformations or Mohr's circle derivations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-322861bd9389e48e31dca6932865cf87</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel12_Verzerrungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1784971017</data>
