<node id="Page 3 - Verzerrungszustand Introduction (page_number)">
  <data key="d0">Page 3 - Verzerrungszustand Introduction (page_number)</data>
  <data key="d1">page_number</data>
  <data key="d2">Page 3 of a German mechanics textbook covering section 12.1 on strain states (Verzerrungszustand). Introduces kinematics of uniaxial deformation of tension rods, deformation of planar bodies (Scheibe), position-dependent displacement vectors, and changes in side lengths/angles under small deformation assumptions. Establishes foundational concepts for strain tensor analysis.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2f01ffec0f2bc0b862fdc1a6a3126dbe</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel12_Verzerrungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1784972043</data>
</node>
