  <data key="d0">Cartesian Basis Vectors</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The unit vectors e_x and e_y of the Cartesian coordinate system used to decompose the displacement vector field into horizontal and vertical components.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-873966c9766a35d08748403615a24d1f</data>
