<node id="Horizontal Displacement Component u(x,y)">
  <data key="d0">Horizontal Displacement Component u(x,y)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A scalar component function representing the horizontal displacement component of the displacement vector field, subject to partial differentiation (∂u/∂x, ∂u/∂y).</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-873966c9766a35d08748403615a24d1f</data>
