</node>
<node id="Vertical Displacement Component v(x,y)">
  <data key="d0">Vertical Displacement Component v(x,y)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A scalar component function representing the vertical displacement component of the displacement vector field, subject to partial differentiation (∂v/∂x, ∂v/∂y).</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-873966c9766a35d08748403615a24d1f</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel12_Verzerrungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1784998906</data>
