<node id="Strain States">
  <data key="d0">Strain States</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The state of deformation of a material, analyzed by linearizing displacement fields.&lt;SEP&gt;Also known as Verzerrungszustand, a topic in mechanics describing the deformation of a body, covered in the lecture material attributed to Technische Mechanik 2.&lt;SEP&gt;Mechanical concepts discussed in continuum mechanics, including plane strain states.&lt;SEP&gt;A technical continuum mechanics concept, also referred to as Verzerrungszustand.</data>
