  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A strain tensor whose derivation is founded on the Taylor expansion of displacement fields.&lt;SEP&gt;A tensor quantifying changes in side lengths and angles of differential volume elements, derived from kinematic descriptions.&lt;SEP&gt;A strain tensor used in finite strain theory, determined by the Hessian matrix of the displacement field.</data>
