<node id="First-Order Taylor Series Approximation of Displacement (equation)">
  <data key="d0">First-Order Taylor Series Approximation of Displacement (equation)</data>
  <data key="d1">equation</data>
  <data key="d2">This equation approximates the displacement of a point at $x+dx$ using a first-order Taylor expansion. It forms the kinematic basis for defining small strains in continuum mechanics. The raw LaTeX likely contains OCR artifacts mistaking the function notation for an integral.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-afdf7262993e514ad26ba97ab4f2a420</data>
