  <data key="d0">Chapter 12.1</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A chapter in a continuum mechanics document covering the topic of strain state (Verzerrungszustand), including multi-dimensional strain analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;A chapter titled 'Verzerrungszustand' (Strain State) in the German engineering mechanics document.&lt;SEP&gt;A section of the technical mechanics document covering strain state (Verzerrungszustand).</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-30b5c4f815450e226a7f0b65824388cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa48b17598f3ede3e70d188e862d9e1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3ee9641e5bb1298b56301c99bff5e12</data>
