  <data key="d2">A severely OCR-corrupted equation from continuum mechanics notes on plane strain state (EVZ). Likely part of the derivation for strain transformation equations, principal directions, or Mohr's strain circle construction, relating strain components (εx, εy, γxy) under coordinate rotation by angle φ. The equation is currently unreadable due to transcription errors.</data>
