<node id="Principal Strain Angle">
  <data key="d0">Principal Strain Angle</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The angle φp that satisfies tan(2φp) = γxy/(εx - εy), derived from extremizing the normal strain under coordinate rotation to find principal directions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-86444d41dc2e58cbf77ceb58838e96c9</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel12_Verzerrungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1784999153</data>
