  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A graphical method (Mohrscher Verzerrungskreis) relating strain components (ε, γ/2) through a circular construction, analogous to the Mohr stress circle.&lt;SEP&gt;Also known as Mohrscher Verzerrungskreis, a graphical method for strain analysis plotted in the coordinate system (epsilon, gamma/2).</data>
