  <data key="d0">Mohr Stress Circle</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A graphical method relating stress components (σ, τ) through a circular construction, used for stress transformation analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;A graphical method analogous to the Mohr strain circle, plotted in the coordinate system (sigma, tau) for stress analysis.</data>
