<node id="Engineering Shear Strain Equation (y-z plane) (equation)">
  <data key="d0">Engineering Shear Strain Equation (y-z plane) (equation)</data>
  <data key="d1">equation</data>
  <data key="d2">This kinematic relation defines the engineering shear strain $\gamma_{yz}$ as the sum of the spatial derivatives of the $y$ and $z$ displacement components. It represents the angular distortion in the y-z plane and is a foundational equation for constructing the strain tensor in 3D continuum mechanics.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-aac206a8f9ab7199ba4ae6138d74c7ec</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel12_Verzerrungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1784981110</data>
</node>
