<node id="Dreidimensionaler Verzerrungstensor (3D Strain Tensor) (equation)">
  <data key="d0">Dreidimensionaler Verzerrungstensor (3D Strain Tensor) (equation)</data>
  <data key="d1">equation</data>
  <data key="d2">The 3D strain tensor matrix expressing the full spatial deformation state at a point, relating normal strains and shear strains. It serves as the kinematic foundation connecting deformation to stress via the elasticity law and enables Mohr's circle analysis for principal strains and directions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ddbe1099c718b59c4f95b165b71f72ab</data>
