  <data key="d1">footer</data>
  <data key="d2">A bibliographic citation footer attributing page content to the textbook 'Technische Mechanik 2' by Gross, Hauger, Schröder, and Wall (2017, Springer Vieweg). It appears on a page covering strain tensors, Mohr's strain circle, and the elasticity law for plane stress states. The footer establishes academic provenance for the lecture material on continuum mechanics topics.</data>
