  <data key="d0">Page 11 - Elastizitätsgesetz and Superposition (page_number)</data>
  <data key="d1">page_number</data>
  <data key="d2">Page number 11 within a German strength of materials document, positioned in section 12.2 covering the elasticity law. The surrounding content addresses the superposition principle and the key insight that a plane stress state (ESZ) leads to a spatial deformation state, connecting stress analysis to strain behavior under isotropic, homogeneous material assumptions.</data>
