  <data key="d1">footer</data>
  <data key="d2">This footer serves as a bibliographic citation attributing the slide's technical content to the textbook 'Technische Mechanik 2' by Gross, Hauger, Schröder, and Wall (2017, Springer Vieweg). It provides academic validation for the complex mechanics concepts discussed, such as elasticity laws and strain states, linking the lecture materials to established peer-reviewed literature.</data>
