</node>
<node id="Constitutive Matrix">
  <data key="d0">Constitutive Matrix</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Full matrix for combined biaxial loading, constructed using the superposition principle from the foundational uniaxial equation&lt;SEP&gt;A matrix relating the stress tensor to the strain tensor in elasticity theory, formed by equations like the generalized Hooke's Law for each strain component</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9d473000f8b85e21224cdb4fbff1c039&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-650f3440dee3d2c3acd18a9d3ea4f7f0</data>
