  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Normal stresses acting on mutually perpendicular planes on which shear stress is zero, transformed from pure shear by a 45-degree coordinate rotation.&lt;SEP&gt;Denoted as $\sigma_1, \sigma_2, \sigma_3$, these are the eigenvalues of the Cauchy stress tensor representing normal stresses.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-40ce366fccc91c18aaa393823e9d843a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c347d0d02f605dcaeeba6088d212ddc8</data>
