<node id="Shear Modulus (G)">
  <data key="d0">Shear Modulus (G)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A material property whose relationship with Young's modulus is derived from the diagram's configuration.&lt;SEP&gt;The reciprocal of the compliance factor 2(1+ν)/E, calculated as G = E/(2(1+ν)).&lt;SEP&gt;A material property whose relationship with Young's Modulus can be derived using a biaxially loaded plate, with the strain equation serving as a foundational step</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-818241f00ae24dac642bd60f22620196&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-004e08ca4afebf77525a1d7810f76686&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7377bf43fb474164c26372581df6f053</data>
