</node>
<node id="Page 15 - Elastizitätsgesetz Derivation Continuation (page_number)">
  <data key="d0">Page 15 - Elastizitätsgesetz Derivation Continuation (page_number)</data>
  <data key="d1">page_number</data>
  <data key="d2">Page number 15 serving as navigational marker within section 12.2 'Elastizitätsgesetz' of a German mechanics textbook. This page continues the mathematical derivation of the relationship between Young's modulus (E-Modul) and shear modulus (Schubmodul) through analysis of a biaxially loaded plate, forming part of an extended theoretical development spanning pages 13-15.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-47751b806b05c6d8ba7d4ccfae665886</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel12_Verzerrungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1784987778</data>
</node>
