  <data key="d2">A page number element displaying '15', located at the bottom-left region of the page (bbox: [29, 907, 43, 927]) on page index 14 (0-based), corresponding to the printed page 15 in a German-language mechanics textbook.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-47751b806b05c6d8ba7d4ccfae665886</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel12_Verzerrungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1784999354</data>
