<node id="Interatomic Bonds">
  <data key="d0">Interatomic Bonds</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The connections between atoms, represented by blue lines in the schematic diagram, which maintain continuity during elastic deformation.</data>
