</node>
<node id="Page 22 - Distortion Energy Hypothesis Derivation (page_number)">
  <data key="d0">Page 22 - Distortion Energy Hypothesis Derivation (page_number)</data>
  <data key="d1">page_number</data>
  <data key="d2">Page 22 contains the third strength hypothesis (Gestaltänderungsenergie), deriving distortion energy from principal stresses and strains. It covers hydrostatic stress separation, uniaxial comparison stress formulation, and establishes the theoretical foundation for equivalent stress calculation in multi-axial stress states.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-00a305b8793d9f114323bcd40953cba6</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel12_Verzerrungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1784993893</data>
</node>
