  <data key="d0">Principal Stresses ($\sigma_1, \sigma_2, \sigma_3$)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Stress components that are combined into a quadratic invariant to correctly formulate the equivalent stress.</data>
