  <data key="d0">Section 12.3 Festigkeitshypothesen (header)</data>
  <data key="d1">header</data>
  <data key="d2">A section header for 'Strength Hypotheses' in a technical mechanics context. It introduces the framework for calculating equivalent stresses from multiaxial loading, specifically covering maximum shear stress and distortion energy theories, to assess material failure and yielding limits.</data>
