<node id="Von Mises Yield Criterion Origin (header)">
  <data key="d0">Von Mises Yield Criterion Origin (header)</data>
  <data key="d1">header</data>
  <data key="d2">This header introduces the 'von Mises' criterion (Shape Change Energy Hypothesis) within a broader discussion on strength hypotheses. It organizes the content related to evaluating multi-axial material stress by calculating equivalent stress through shape change energy, connecting theoretical derivations to their historical originator.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d00610e182d45a94eb2e712fcaa111a3</data>
  <data key="d4">Kapitel12_Verzerrungszustand.pdf</data>
