<node id="Material Type Applicability Conclusion (header)">
  <data key="d0">Material Type Applicability Conclusion (header)</data>
  <data key="d1">header</data>
  <data key="d2">An evaluative header stating 'Good agreement for ductile materials' (Gute Übereinstimmung bei duktilem Material). It concludes the discussion on strength hypotheses (shear stress and distortion energy), emphasizing their validity specifically for ductile materials, bridging theoretical derivations to practical material science applications.</data>
