</edge>
<edge source="Elastizitätsgesetz" target="3D Hooke's Law">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The 3D Hooke's Law is discussed in the document as the Elastizitätsgesetz under thermal expansion.</data>
  <data key="d10">equivalence,translation</data>
