</edge>
<edge source="Normal Stress" target="Strength of Materials">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The normal stress relationship is foundational in strength of materials (Festigkeitslehre), serving as the basis for more complex stress analyses.</data>
