<edge source="Normal Stress" target="Stress Tensor">
  <data key="d8">5.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The normal stresses form the main diagonal components of the stress tensor&lt;SEP&gt;Normal stress is a component of the stress state described by the stress tensor.&lt;SEP&gt;Normal stress components sigma_xx, sigma_yy, and sigma_zz are integral parts of the stress tensor acting on faces perpendicular to the x, y, and z axes respectively&lt;SEP&gt;The stress tensor contains three normal stresses (σ_xx, σ_yy, σ_zz) on its main diagonal.&lt;SEP&gt;The stress tensor includes normal stress components σx and σy as part of its entries.</data>
  <data key="d10">component,components,composition,consists of,contains,includes,main diagonal</data>
