</edge>
<edge source="Normal Stress" target="Continuum Mechanics">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">In continuum mechanics, normal stresses and strains are evaluated in the principal axes system.</data>
  <data key="d10">analyzes,evaluates</data>
