<edge source="Strain" target="Hooke's Law">
  <data key="d8">5.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Hooke's Law connects stress analysis to strain (Dehnung) and elastic deformation behavior&lt;SEP&gt;Hooke's Law establishes the constitutive relationship between stress and strain in the linear-elastic region.&lt;SEP&gt;Hooke's law σ = E·ε is used to determine strain&lt;SEP&gt;Hooke's law σ = E·ε relates stress to strain through the material stiffness&lt;SEP&gt;Hooke's law (σ = Eε) relates stress to strain.</data>
  <data key="d10">connects,determines,governs,relates</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-cf7cfa532d0224ec6532c6354495df59&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5cc011b4f71d9c304cbdecd2839b81e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f4f759f99f5a784630c625df026ca993&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-783555881f4ab73d4d04ea548b9fae1b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b12d2d988ba8fdb94bda0bb9243511d</data>
