<edge source="Strain" target="Kinematic Relation">
  <data key="d8">3.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The kinematic relation defines strain as the spatial derivative of the displacement field.&lt;SEP&gt;The kinematic relation ε = u'(x) defines strain as the spatial derivative of displacement&lt;SEP&gt;The kinematic relation ε = du/dx defines strain as the spatial derivative of displacement.</data>
