<edge source="Elastizitätsmodell" target="Chapter 10: Tension And Compression In Bars">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The elasticity model is identified as a foundational pillar of Chapter 10, describing material behavior.</data>
  <data key="d10">foundational pillar,topic</data>
