<edge source="Hooke's Law" target="Elastic Modulus">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Hooke's Law uses the elastic modulus as the proportional factor mapping strain to stress.&lt;SEP&gt;Hooke's law uses the elastic modulus to scale the linear relationship between stress and strain.</data>
