<edge source="Gross" target="Technische Mechanik 2">
  <data key="d8">61.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The relation (Gross, Technische Mechanik 2) establishes the authorship connection between the individual Gross and the academic textbook titled "Technische Mechanik 2". Across the various descriptions provided, there is a unanimous consensus that Gross is definitively credited as a writer of this specific educational text.

While some descriptions broadly refer to Gross simply as an author, the vast majority specifically identify him as a co-author. This indicates that the textbook was a collaborative effort involving multiple contributors. Specifically, it is noted that Gross is one of four co-authors who collaborated on the book. Furthermore, the descriptions provide a temporal context for this authorial relationship, documenting that Gross co-authored an edition of "Technische Mechanik 2" that was published in the year 2017. Overall, this relation definitively outlines Gross's fundamental role as a contributing writer and one of four co-authors of the 2017 publication of this academic work.</data>
