<edge source="Technische Mechanik 2" target="Hauger">
  <data key="d8">61.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The relation (Hauger, Technische Mechanik 2) establishes the authorial role of Hauger regarding the educational textbook titled "Technische Mechanik 2." This relationship consistently identifies Hauger as an author who contributed to this academic publication.

More specifically, the available information documents Hauger as a co-author, indicating that the creation of the textbook was a collaborative effort. He is explicitly recognized as being one of the four co-authors who collaborated on the book.

Furthermore, this authorial relationship is tied to a specific publication event, as Hauger's verified contribution as a co-author is associated with the 2017 edition of the "Technische Mechanik 2" textbook. Ultimately, this relation serves to comprehensively document his collaborative role in the authorship of this educational resource.</data>
  <data key="d10">Author,Author Of,Publication,author,author of,authored,authored by,authorship,co-author,publication,written by,wrote</data>
