<edge source="Technische Mechanik 2" target="Wall">
  <data key="d8">61.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The relation (Technische Mechanik 2, Wall) designates the professional and academic association between Wall and the educational textbook titled "Technische Mechanik 2." This relation explicitly identifies Wall as an author of the specified textbook, documenting a credited role in the creation of this educational material.

Further details consistently highlight the collaborative nature of this authorship, recognizing Wall specifically as one of four co-authors who contributed to the writing and compilation of the textbook. Additionally, the work associated with this relation is noted to have been published in the year 2017. Ultimately, the relationship serves as a verified record of Wall's tangible contribution to the development, writing, and publication of "Technische Mechanik 2."</data>
