<edge source="Technische Mechanik 2" target="Springer Vieweg">
  <data key="d8">64.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The relation between Springer Vieweg and "Technische Mechanik 2" represents a definitive publishing connection within the academic and educational sectors. In this relationship, the entity Springer Vieweg acts as the official academic publisher of the textbook titled "Technische Mechanik 2." This establishes Springer Vieweg as the responsible organization for the production, distribution, and overall publication of this specific educational work.

Furthermore, the details of this publishing relationship are consistently anchored to a specific timeframe. Available data indicates that Springer Vieweg officially published the textbook "Technische Mechanik 2" in the year 2017. This timeline confirms the publisher's role in overseeing the release and dissemination of the 2017 edition of this engineering textbook to the academic public.</data>
