<edge source="Technische Mechanik 2" target="Strength Of Materials">
  <data key="d8">9.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The relation "(Strength Of Materials, Technische Mechanik 2)" defines the topical focus and academic classification of a specific educational resource within the broader engineering curriculum. It establishes that the textbook "Technische Mechanik 2"—specifically recognized as Volume 2 of a broader academic series—comprehensively covers the subject, concepts, and fundamental theories associated with the strength of materials domain.

Within the context of engineering education, this relationship highlights that the textbook's content is intrinsically linked to the field of strength of materials. The volume is dedicated specifically to this discipline, ensuring that the principles, topics, and subject matter of strength of materials serve as the primary focus of its instructional material.</data>
