<edge source="Technische Mechanik 2" target="Einzelstab">
  <data key="d8">4.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Technische Mechanik 2 includes structural analysis of a single rod (Einzelstab).&lt;SEP&gt;The textbook serves as the academic origin and reference for principles concerning the elastostatic modeling of single bars.&lt;SEP&gt;The textbook provides academic standard and provenance for equations related to the mechanical analysis of a single rod.&lt;SEP&gt;The textbook 'Technische Mechanik 2' serves as a reference source for content on single bar/rod analysis (Einzelstab).</data>
