  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The presence of stress peaks shows that the elementary assumption of uniform stress is not exactly valid at the points of force application.</data>
  <data key="d10">contradicts,invalidates</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-8f7107d9e481e8d7b78079a1c4ff9229</data>
  <data key="d12">Kapitel10_Elastostatik_Zug_und_Druck_in_Stäben.pdf</data>
