</edge>
<edge source="Hanging Bar Under Self-Weight" target="Kinematic Constitutive Relationship For Axial Deformation">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The hanging bar under self-weight is an example where the governing differential equation is integrated to obtain the displacement field.</data>
