  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Equation dN/dx + n = 0" target="Governing Second-order Differential Equation">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The equilibrium equation, when combined with other relations, produces the governing second-order differential equation for the displacement field.</data>
  <data key="d10">combines,produces</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-b5cc011b4f71d9c304cbdecd2839b81e</data>
