</edge>
<edge source="n" target="G">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The distributed line load n is computed as n = G/l, where G is the total weight of the bar.&lt;SEP&gt;The distributed load n is calculated by dividing the total weight G by the length l of the bar.</data>
  <data key="d10">calculation,derived from,equals,relationship</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-b5cc011b4f71d9c304cbdecd2839b81e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17b87724a453e2805522671a76c088ec</data>
