<edge source="Governing Ordinary Differential Equation (ODE)" target="Linear-elastic Constitutive Law">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The governing ODE is formed by incorporating the linear-elastic constitutive law into the equilibrium condition.</data>
  <data key="d10">arises from,derived from</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-1dfca5c7dbae86836330061b0f49bc01</data>
  <data key="d12">Kapitel10_Elastostatik_Zug_und_Druck_in_Stäben.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1784897129</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Governing Ordinary Differential Equation (ODE)" target="General Solution u(x)">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The general solution is found by integrating the governing ODE twice to determine the axial displacement field.</data>
  <data key="d10">integrates,solves</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-1dfca5c7dbae86836330061b0f49bc01</data>
  <data key="d12">Kapitel10_Elastostatik_Zug_und_Druck_in_Stäben.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1784897129</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Governing Ordinary Differential Equation (ODE)" target="Stabtragwerk Analysis">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The governing ODE is foundational in Stabtragwerk analysis for computing stress distributions and elongation.</data>
  <data key="d10">basis for,foundational to</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-1dfca5c7dbae86836330061b0f49bc01</data>
  <data key="d12">Kapitel10_Elastostatik_Zug_und_Druck_in_Stäben.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1784897129</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Governing Ordinary Differential Equation (ODE)" target="Statically Determinate Hanging Bar">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The governing ODE mathematically describes the physical behavior of a statically determinate hanging bar under self-weight.</data>
  <data key="d10">describes,models</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-1dfca5c7dbae86836330061b0f49bc01</data>
  <data key="d12">Kapitel10_Elastostatik_Zug_und_Druck_in_Stäben.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1784897129</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Governing Ordinary Differential Equation (ODE)" target="Statically Indeterminate Cases">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The mathematical framework provided by the governing ODE is later extended to solve statically indeterminate cases.</data>
  <data key="d10">extended to,framework for</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-1dfca5c7dbae86836330061b0f49bc01</data>
