<edge source="Axial Displacement Field u(x)" target="Elongation Equation Δl = u(l) − u(0)">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The elongation equation expresses the total change in length as the difference of the axial displacement field evaluated at the rod's boundaries.</data>
