<edge source="Continuum Mechanics" target="Verzerrungszustand">
  <data key="d8">5.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The content of the Verzerrungszustand section is critical for understanding continuum mechanics.&lt;SEP&gt;Verzerrungszustand (strain state analysis) is a core topic within continuum mechanics.&lt;SEP&gt;Verzerrungszustand, or strain state analysis, is a fundamental context within continuum mechanics.&lt;SEP&gt;Verzerrungszustand (strain state) is a fundamental concept within the field of continuum mechanics.&lt;SEP&gt;Verzerrungszustand (strain analysis) is studied within the surrounding context of continuum mechanics.</data>
  <data key="d10">branch,context,critical for,part of,subfield,subject within,topic within</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-2f01ffec0f2bc0b862fdc1a6a3126dbe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4977643a568de41c3595cee58107e8d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-73f6cf7471ec2d0c8d45890d1117b1c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-30b5c4f815450e226a7f0b65824388cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7992b48b195836a401d5e2640f4cca33</data>
  <data key="d12">Kapitel12_Verzerrungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1784999619</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Continuum Mechanics" target="Displacement Vector Field Equation">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The displacement vector field equation is fundamental to continuum mechanics, establishing the kinematic foundation for deformation analysis.</data>
  <data key="d10">fundamental to,kinematic foundation</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-873966c9766a35d08748403615a24d1f</data>
  <data key="d12">Kapitel12_Verzerrungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1784999713</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Continuum Mechanics" target="Infinitesimal Strain Tensor">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The infinitesimal strain tensor is a foundational step in understanding the linearized kinematics of deformation in continuum mechanics.</data>
  <data key="d10">part of</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-646c9364260cc8f0c76b71d04358c907</data>
  <data key="d12">Kapitel12_Verzerrungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1784999716</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Continuum Mechanics" target="Deformable Body">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Continuum mechanics provides the surrounding context for the strain state analysis of a deformable body.</data>
  <data key="d10">analyzes,context</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-266b49cf12495861b99ca9dc21275e0d</data>
  <data key="d12">Kapitel12_Verzerrungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1784999717</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Continuum Mechanics" target="Strain State Analysis">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Strain state analysis is situated within the surrounding physical context of continuum mechanics.&lt;SEP&gt;Strain state analysis is a specific context and application within the broader field of continuum mechanics.</data>
  <data key="d10">context,context of,involves</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-266b49cf12495861b99ca9dc21275e0d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39b2f0f24ccabd94f6101afe155c90b1</data>
  <data key="d12">Kapitel12_Verzerrungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1784999717</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Continuum Mechanics" target="Normal Strain (ε_x)">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The normal strain ε_x is central to the kinematics of deformation in continuum mechanics</data>
  <data key="d10">central to</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-0deb8f7c8c663233e195e68e3b5afeea</data>
