<edge source="Elongation Equation Δl = u(l) − u(0)" target="Strain Field ε(x)">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The elongation equation is derived by integrating the strain field ε(x) = du/dx over the rod length from 0 to l.</data>
  <data key="d10">derived from,integration of</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-0963d089a81497869e206f806e6e66d1</data>
