</edge>
<edge source="Uniformly Hanging Rod" target="Second-Order Ordinary Differential Equation">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Second-Order Ordinary Differential Equation governs the axial deformation of the Uniformly Hanging Rod.</data>
