  <data key="d13">1784904215</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Cauchy Stress Tensor" target="Moment Equilibrium Condition">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The moment equilibrium condition (τ_xy = τ_yx, etc.) reduces the nine components of the Cauchy stress tensor to six independent ones.&lt;SEP&gt;The symmetry property of the Cauchy stress tensor arises from the moment equilibrium condition about coordinate axes</data>
  <data key="d10">derived from,equilibrium,reduction,symmetry</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-7c2c59e0f6a23f968e67f68fc9498278&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0bd290e24d36ba227108f0e9b5c1965e</data>
