  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Cauchy Stress Tensor" target="Cross Shear Stresses">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The equality of cross shear stresses demonstrates that the Cauchy stress tensor is a symmetric matrix.</data>
  <data key="d10">establishes symmetry of</data>
