  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The fundamental equilibrium condition enforces that the Cauchy stress tensor is a symmetric matrix.&lt;SEP&gt;The Cauchy stress tensor is represented as a 3x3 symmetric matrix</data>
