  <data key="d9">The Cauchy stress tensor demonstrates that shear stresses are symmetric (σ_xy = σ_yx, σ_xz = σ_zx, σ_yz = σ_zy) through moment equilibrium about coordinate axes through Point P.&lt;SEP&gt;The Cauchy stress tensor contains shear stresses as its off-diagonal elements</data>
