<edge source="Infinitesimal Rod Element" target="Differential Equation dN/dx + n = 0">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The infinitesimal element approach is essential for formulating the governing differential equation dN/dx + n = 0.</data>
  <data key="d10">essential for,formulates</data>
