  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Infinitesimal Rod Element" target="Continuous Field Equations">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The infinitesimal differential element approach enables the transition to continuous field equations, ultimately yielding the rod's deformation behavior.</data>
