<edge source="Shear Stress" target="Shear Strain">
  <data key="d8">5.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Shear stress is proportional to shear strain via the relationship $\tau_{xy} = G \cdot \gamma_{xy}$&lt;SEP&gt;Shear strain is directly proportional to shear stress and inversely proportional to the shear modulus.&lt;SEP&gt;The shear strain is calculated as τ_xy/G, directly relating it to the shear stress component.&lt;SEP&gt;Shear strain is mathematically defined as the ratio of shear stress to the Shear Modulus.&lt;SEP&gt;Shear stress is directly related to shear strain via the Shear Modulus.</data>
  <data key="d10">calculated from,equation,induced by,mathematical definition,proportional,proportional to,relates,relationship</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-9d473000f8b85e21224cdb4fbff1c039&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0e5bb0f8636d66563ae50a1af38ba22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90b46de3a3db50a2d58052925f2088b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-926a4442fa510b596bda13f5de11afb4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-963728870ca7c1f5d880eae3e1e47f0f</data>
