  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">In a uniaxial stress state, the equivalent uniaxial tensile stress ($\sigma_V$) equals the first principal stress ($\sigma_1$), while $\sigma_2 = \sigma_3 = 0$.</data>
