<edge source="Principal Stresses" target="Deviatoric Stresses">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Deviatoric stresses are calculated by subtracting the hydrostatic stress from the principal stresses ($s_i = \sigma_i - \sigma$).</data>
