</edge>
<edge source="Principal Stresses" target="Hydrostatic Stress">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The hydrostatic stress σ is defined as the arithmetic mean of the three principal stresses: σ = (σ_1 + σ_2 + σ_3)/3.</data>
  <data key="d10">mean value</data>
