  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The internal pressure induces the circumferential or hoop stress around the perimeter of the cylinder.&lt;SEP&gt;Internal pressure acting on the projected rectangular area of the half-cylinder induces circumferential stresses across the cut surfaces of the vessel wall.</data>
