<edge source="Thin-walled Cylindrical Pressure Vessel" target="Plane Stress Condition (ESZ)">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The plane stress condition (ESZ) is a fundamental assumption in the analysis of thin-walled cylindrical pressure vessels, where radial stresses are negligible due to high radius-to-thickness ratio.</data>
  <data key="d10">analysis,assumption</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-dfafff355a9da39ab811d6385cb83520</data>
  <data key="d12">Kapitel11_Spannungszustand.pdf</data>
