<edge source="Thin-walled Cylindrical Pressure Vessel" target="Section 11.2.4">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Section 11.2.4 begins the theoretical examination of thin-walled cylindrical pressure vessels subjected to internal pressure.</data>
