<edge source="Thin-walled Cylindrical Pressure Vessel" target="Internal Pressure">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The thin-walled cylindrical pressure vessel is subjected to internal pressure.&lt;SEP&gt;The uniform internal pressure p acts radially outward against the inner walls of the cylinder, creating the stress state analyzed in the diagram.</data>
  <data key="d10">acts on,load,loads,subjected to</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-dfafff355a9da39ab811d6385cb83520&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b026fcfc3bb4dcf15d90b692b7902eb</data>
