<edge source="Thin-walled Cylindrical Pressure Vessel" target="Force Equilibrium">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The longitudinal stresses in the thin-walled cylindrical pressure vessel are derived through force equilibrium.</data>
