<edge source="Thin-walled Cylindrical Pressure Vessel" target="Longitudinal Stress">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The longitudinal stress σx acts axially along the cylinder's wall, representing one of the two principal stresses resulting from the internal pressure.</data>
