<edge source="Stress Transformation Equations" target="Mohr's Circle">
  <data key="d8">3.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Stress transformation equations form the mathematical basis for Mohr's circle&lt;SEP&gt;Stress transformation equations involving trigonometric functions of 2φ form the analytical basis for Mohr's circle construction.&lt;SEP&gt;Mohr's Circle serves as the graphical-analytical representation of the stress transformation equations.</data>
  <data key="d10">basis for,foundation,graphical representation of</data>
