  <data key="d9">σ_M is the center point of Mohr's Circle, located on the horizontal σ-axis.&lt;SEP&gt;σ_M is the center of the Mohr's Circle, located exactly midway between σ₂=0 and σ₁=σ₀ on the σ-axis.</data>
