<edge source="Hydrostatic Stress" target="Normal Stress Transformation Equation">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">In the special case of hydrostatic stress (σ_x = σ_y, τ_xy = 0), the equation reduces to σ_η = σ_x = σ_y.</data>
