<edge source="Principal Stress Directions" target="Stationarity Condition For Normal Stresses">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The stationarity condition dσ_ξ/dφ = 0 is the fundamental mathematical condition used to determine the principal stress directions (Hauptrichtungen).</data>
