<edge source="2D Stress Tensor" target="Invariant I₁">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Invariant I₁ is the trace of the 2D stress tensor (σ_x + σ_y), remaining constant under coordinate rotation.</data>
