  <data key="d11">chunk-0658f7561c12b0a53196517bdee01443</data>
  <data key="d12">Kapitel11_Spannungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1784904205</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="2D Stress Tensor" target="Invariant I₂">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Invariant I₂ is the determinant of the 2D stress tensor (σ_x·σ_y - τ_xy²), remaining constant under coordinate rotation.</data>
  <data key="d10">determinant,invariant</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-0658f7561c12b0a53196517bdee01443</data>
  <data key="d12">Kapitel11_Spannungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1784904205</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Invariant I₁" target="Characteristic Equation">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The characteristic equation σ² - I₁σ + I₂ = 0 uses the invariant I₁ as a coefficient.</data>
