</edge>
<edge source="X-Direction Equilibrium Equation" target="Differential Equilibrium Equation">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">When the force balance terms are algebraically simplified by canceling common terms and dividing by dx·dy·t, the differential equilibrium equation is obtained</data>
