<edge source="Cauchy's Stress Theorem" target="Traction Vector">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Cauchy's stress theorem defines the traction vector as t = σ·n, depending on the stress tensor and the unit normal vector.</data>
