<edge source="Principal Axis System (Hauptachsensystem)" target="Maximum Shear Stress (τ_max)">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The maximum shear stress magnitude relates to the principal stresses σ₁ and σ₂ as τ_max = |σ₁ - σ₂| / 2</data>
  <data key="d10">formula relation</data>
