<edge source="Maximum Shear Stress (τ_max)" target="Tresca Yield Criterion">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Tresca yield criterion uses the maximum shear stress to predict yielding and material failure&lt;SEP&gt;The Tresca Yield Criterion postulates that plastic deformation begins when the Maximum Shear Stress (τ_max) reaches a critical value.</data>
