  <data key="d13">1784999716</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Material Point P" target="Equation $u_Q = u_P + (\partial u/\partial x)dx + (\partial u/\partial y)dy$">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The Taylor series expression for the displacement at point Q is fundamentally based on the displacement at point P.</data>
  <data key="d10">based on</data>
