  <data key="d9">Entity Taylor Series Expansion belongs to First-Order Bivariate Taylor Series Expansion (Linearization of Scalar Field) (equation)&lt;SEP&gt;Entity Taylor Series Expansion belongs to First-Order Bivariate Taylor Series Expansion (Linearization of Scalar Field) (equation)</data>
