  <data key="d9">Entity Taylor Series Expansion belongs to Normal Strain Component ε_y - Kinematic Strain-Displacement Relation (equation)&lt;SEP&gt;Entity Taylor Series Expansion belongs to Normal Strain Component ε_y - Kinematic Strain-Displacement Relation (equation)</data>
  <data key="d10">belongs_to,contained_in,part_of</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-8f7db4e56e1df22cfa2dc24d5b3992b9</data>
  <data key="d8">20.0</data>
