<edge source="Shear Strain" target="Compliance Matrix Formulation">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Shear strain represents one of the vector components in the compliance matrix formulation alongside normal strains.&lt;SEP&gt;The compliance form calculates shear strain from shear stress.</data>
  <data key="d10">Calculates,Outputs,component of</data>
