  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Shear Strain" target="Shear Modulus">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The shear strain is inversely proportional to the shear modulus, as expressed in the equation γ_xy = τ_xy/G.&lt;SEP&gt;Shear strain is mathematically defined as the ratio of shear stress to the Shear Modulus.</data>
  <data key="d10">inversely proportional to,mathematical definition,proportional to</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-90b46de3a3db50a2d58052925f2088b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-926a4442fa510b596bda13f5de11afb4</data>
