<edge source="Normal Strain (ε_x)" target="Displacement Field (u)">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The normal strain ε_x equals the spatial gradient ∂u/∂x of the displacement field component for small deformations</data>
  <data key="d10">defined by,gradient relationship</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-0deb8f7c8c663233e195e68e3b5afeea</data>
  <data key="d12">Kapitel12_Verzerrungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1784999720</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Normal Strain (ε_x)" target="Line Segment PQ">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The normal strain ε_x is computed as the relative elongation of the originally straight line segment PQ</data>
  <data key="d10">computed from,elongation</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-0deb8f7c8c663233e195e68e3b5afeea</data>
  <data key="d12">Kapitel12_Verzerrungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1784999721</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Normal Strain (ε_x)" target="Strain Tensor (ε_ij)">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The strain tensor ε_ij generalizes the normal strain ε_x within the framework of linear elasticity</data>
  <data key="d10">generalizes,related to</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-0deb8f7c8c663233e195e68e3b5afeea</data>
  <data key="d12">Kapitel12_Verzerrungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1784999721</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Displacement Field (u)" target="Surface Bodies (Scheiben)">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The displacement vector field u is position-dependent and is bridged with the kinematic description of deformation of surface bodies (Scheiben)</data>
  <data key="d10">bridges with</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-0deb8f7c8c663233e195e68e3b5afeea</data>
  <data key="d12">Kapitel12_Verzerrungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1784999721</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Line Segment PQ" target="Line Segment P'Q'">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">P'Q' is the deformed configuration of the originally straight line segment PQ after deformation</data>
  <data key="d10">deformed configuration</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-0deb8f7c8c663233e195e68e3b5afeea</data>
  <data key="d12">Kapitel12_Verzerrungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1784999721</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
