  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Strain Tensor Components" target="Line Element PQ">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The line element PQ is essential for defining the local deformation gradient and formulating the symmetric strain tensor used to derive strain components.</data>
