<edge source="Normal Strain Epsilon Y" target="Displacement Field Component V">
  <data key="d8">2.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Normal strain epsilon_y is mathematically defined as the partial derivative of the displacement field component v with respect to the y-coordinate.&lt;SEP&gt;The normal strain ε_y is defined as ∂v/∂y.</data>
