</edge>
<edge source="Engineering Shear Strain Gamma_xy" target="Vertical Line Element">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Evaluating the vertical line element alongside the horizontal one allows the combination of angular changes to define the engineering shear strain.</data>
