<edge source="Shear Strain Gamma Xy" target="Planar Strain Tensor">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The shear strain γ_xy defines the off-diagonal components of the planar strain tensor.</data>
  <data key="d10">defines off-diagonal components of</data>
