  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Planar Strain Tensor" target="Macroscopic Deformations">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The off-diagonal components of the planar strain tensor relate macroscopic deformations to the underlying displacement field.</data>
