  <data key="d9">Entity Engineering Shear Strain γ_xy belongs to Shear Stress-Strain Constitutive Relation (Hooke's Law for Shear) (equation)&lt;SEP&gt;Entity Engineering Shear Strain γ_xy belongs to Shear Stress-Strain Constitutive Relation (Hooke's Law for Shear) (equation)</data>
