  <data key="d9">Entity Shear Modulus G belongs to Constitutive Equation for Strain in y-direction under Plane Stress (Hooke's Law, ESZ) (equation)&lt;SEP&gt;Entity Shear Modulus G belongs to Constitutive Equation for Strain in y-direction under Plane Stress (Hooke's Law, ESZ) (equation)</data>
