<edge source="Engineering Shear Strain Component Gamma_xz" target="Displacement Field Component u(x,y,z)">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The engineering shear strain component gamma_xz is calculated using the partial derivative of the displacement field component u(x,y,z) with respect to z.</data>
  <data key="d10">calculated from,uses</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-b9a00e68fbbec347e4cd88332c5f0573</data>
  <data key="d12">Kapitel12_Verzerrungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1784999786</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Engineering Shear Strain Component Gamma_xz" target="Displacement Field Component w(x,y,z)">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The engineering shear strain component gamma_xz is calculated using the partial derivative of the displacement field component w(x,y,z) with respect to x.</data>
  <data key="d10">calculated from,uses</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-b9a00e68fbbec347e4cd88332c5f0573</data>
