  <data key="d13">1784999786</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Engineering Shear Strain Component Gamma_xz" target="Strain Tensor epsilon_ij">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The engineering shear strain component gamma_xz is directly connected to the strain tensor epsilon_ij, where the tensorial shear component is half of the engineering shear strain.</data>
  <data key="d10">component of,related to</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-b9a00e68fbbec347e4cd88332c5f0573</data>
  <data key="d12">Kapitel12_Verzerrungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1784999787</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Displacement Field Component u(x,y,z)" target="Partial Derivative Operators">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Partial derivative operators are applied to the displacement field component u(x,y,z) to calculate the rate of change and rotations.</data>
  <data key="d10">applied to,differentiates</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-b9a00e68fbbec347e4cd88332c5f0573</data>
  <data key="d12">Kapitel12_Verzerrungszustand.pdf</data>
