<edge source="Transverse Strain" target="Poisson Effect">
  <data key="d8">3.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Transverse strain is the measurable physical result of the Poisson effect during uniaxial loading.&lt;SEP&gt;The negative sign in transverse strain encodes the Poisson effect, where tensile loading produces transverse contraction&lt;SEP&gt;Transverse strain results from lateral contraction induced through Poisson's effect.</data>
  <data key="d10">causation,defines,describes,physical behavior,results from</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-b73317ca6218a3794fd92d7cfec3e4db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d473000f8b85e21224cdb4fbff1c039&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90b46de3a3db50a2d58052925f2088b0</data>
  <data key="d12">Kapitel12_Verzerrungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1784999794</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Transverse Strain" target="Generalized Hooke's Law Constitutive Matrix">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The equation defining transverse strain forms a part of the generalized Hooke's Law constitutive matrix.</data>
  <data key="d10">includes,incorporates</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-b73317ca6218a3794fd92d7cfec3e4db</data>
  <data key="d12">Kapitel12_Verzerrungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1784999794</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Transverse Strain" target="Mohr's Circles for Strain">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Mohr's circles for strain are used as a practical engineering method to analyze transformations involving transverse strain.</data>
  <data key="d10">analyzes,transforms</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-b73317ca6218a3794fd92d7cfec3e4db</data>
  <data key="d12">Kapitel12_Verzerrungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1784999794</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Transverse Strain" target="Plate Structures">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The transverse strain relationship is used to predict lateral contractions in plate structures.</data>
  <data key="d10">analyzes,predicts</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-b73317ca6218a3794fd92d7cfec3e4db</data>
