<edge source="Shear Stress-Shear Strain Constitutive Relation" target="Hooke's Law In Shear">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Hooke's law in shear is represented mathematically by the shear stress-shear strain constitutive relation equation.</data>
  <data key="d10">equation,represented by</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-372d45ee57b3e8dd4b75b8ce18594fad</data>
  <data key="d12">Kapitel12_Verzerrungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1784999847</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Shear Stress-Shear Strain Constitutive Relation" target="Generalized 3D Hooke's Law">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The shear stress-shear strain relation is one component of the generalized 3D Hooke's law tensorial form.</data>
  <data key="d10">component,includes</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-372d45ee57b3e8dd4b75b8ce18594fad</data>
  <data key="d12">Kapitel12_Verzerrungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1784999847</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Shear Stress-Shear Strain Constitutive Relation" target="Constitutive Matrix For Plane Stress Analysis">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The constitutive matrix for plane stress analysis incorporates the shear stress-strain relation combined with normal stress-strain relations.</data>
  <data key="d10">combines,incorporates</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-372d45ee57b3e8dd4b75b8ce18594fad</data>
  <data key="d12">Kapitel12_Verzerrungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1784999847</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Shear Stress-Shear Strain Constitutive Relation" target="Linear-Elastic Isotropic Material">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The constitutive relation is valid for linear-elastic, isotropic materials under plane stress conditions within the linear-elastic regime before yielding.</data>
  <data key="d10">applies to,valid for</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-372d45ee57b3e8dd4b75b8ce18594fad</data>
  <data key="d12">Kapitel12_Verzerrungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1784999847</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Shear Stress-Shear Strain Constitutive Relation" target="Deviatoric Deformation">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The shear stress-shear strain relation applies to the deviatoric (shape-changing) component of deformation.</data>
  <data key="d10">applies to,shape-changing</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-372d45ee57b3e8dd4b75b8ce18594fad</data>
  <data key="d12">Kapitel12_Verzerrungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1784999847</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Hooke's Law In Shear" target="Uniaxial Hooke's Law">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The uniaxial Hooke's law σ = E · ε is analogous to Hooke's law in shear, but applies to axial deformation rather than deviatoric deformation.</data>
  <data key="d10">analogous to,counterpart</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-372d45ee57b3e8dd4b75b8ce18594fad</data>
  <data key="d12">Kapitel12_Verzerrungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1784999847</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Generalized 3D Hooke's Law" target="Normal Stress-Strain Relations">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The generalized 3D Hooke's law tensorial form includes the normal stress-strain relations along with the shear stress-strain relation.</data>
  <data key="d10">component,includes</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-372d45ee57b3e8dd4b75b8ce18594fad</data>
  <data key="d12">Kapitel12_Verzerrungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1784999847</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Constitutive Matrix For Plane Stress Analysis" target="Normal Stress-Strain Relations">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The constitutive matrix for plane stress analysis combines the shear stress-strain relation with normal stress-strain relations.</data>
  <data key="d10">combines,incorporates</data>
  <data key="d11">chunk-372d45ee57b3e8dd4b75b8ce18594fad</data>
  <data key="d12">Kapitel12_Verzerrungszustand.pdf</data>
  <data key="d13">1784999847</data>
  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
