  <data key="d9">Entity Linear Isotropic Elasticity belongs to Isotropic Shear Modulus Relationship (Hooke's Law for Shear) (equation)&lt;SEP&gt;Entity Linear Isotropic Elasticity belongs to Isotropic Shear Modulus Relationship (Hooke's Law for Shear) (equation)</data>
