  <data key="d8">3.0</data>
  <data key="d9">The distortion energy hypothesis is also known as the von Mises yield criterion.&lt;SEP&gt;The distortion energy hypothesis is associated with the von Mises yield criterion as an equivalent formulation.&lt;SEP&gt;The von Mises yield criterion is also referred to as the Distortion Energy Hypothesis.</data>
