  <data key="d9">Entity Von Mises Yield Criterion belongs to Principal Strain Hooke's Law (Third Principal Direction) (equation)&lt;SEP&gt;Entity Von Mises Yield Criterion belongs to Principal Strain Hooke's Law (Third Principal Direction) (equation)</data>
