<edge source="Hydrostatic Strain Energy Density" target="Von Mises Equivalent Stress">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Hydrostatic strain energy density is a fundamental building block for calculating the von Mises equivalent stress.</data>
