  <data key="d14"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Hydrostatic Strain Energy Density" target="Total Strain Energy">
  <data key="d8">1.0</data>
  <data key="d9">Hydrostatic strain energy density is the subtractive term used to decompose total strain energy into volumetric and distortional components.</data>
